# Optional local overrides. GitHub Actions infers these automatically.
# SITE_URL=https://username.github.io
# BASE_PATH=/repository-name

# Giscus and tawk.to public IDs live in src/data/site.json, not in secrets.
# For automatic Chinese -> English translation, add a GitHub Actions repository
# secret named DEEPSEEK_API_KEY. Never commit the real value here.
# The workflow hard-codes deepseek-v4-flash with thinking disabled.
